## Task Entry Points

| Tool | Entry Point |
|------|-------------|
| Cursor | `unified-trading-pm/plans/tasks/cursor/START_HERE.md` |
| Claude Code | `unified-trading-pm/plans/tasks/claude-code/START.md` |

## DO

- Reference these paths when launching agents or assigning tasks
- Add new prompts to `plans/prompts/` and update this index
- Use `START_HERE.md` (Cursor) or `START.md` (Claude Code) as the task entry point

## NEVER

- Create prompts in service repos, codex, or workspace root
- Assume prompts live elsewhere without checking this index

